### ti-export-api — direct call, port 8084
# NOT reachable through the gateway: this endpoint lives under /rest/v1/**, and the
# gateway only proxies /api/v1/**. Call the service directly when testing standalone.

### Export all questions as CSV (binary attachment response)
GET http://localhost:8084/rest/v1/export/csv?fields=all
Accept: application/octet-stream

###

### Export a filtered subset as Excel
GET http://localhost:8084/rest/v1/export/excel?fields=id,question,shortAnswer&projects=1&tags=17
Accept: application/octet-stream

###

### Version check
GET http://localhost:8084/rest/v1/version
Accept: text/plain

###
